Record why the alteration is wrong
State the expected negative effect
Pair explanation with altered protocol" style="shape=document;boundedLbl=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9E9E9E;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="-8" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="6" value="Send to Additional Experts
Use a second question-writing round
Hide no relevant altered context
